          "structuredContent": {
            "modules": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<h2>HALLOWEEN ON THE SCREEN AT THE GRIFFIN 🎃</h2><p><br></p><p>This October, <strong><strong>The Griffin garden is getting a seriously spooky makeover.</strong></strong></p><p>The festoon lights are staying, but everything else is going dark...</p><p>Think glowing pumpkins, cobwebs, candlelight, creepy corners and our <strong><strong>huge 15ft outdoor screen</strong></strong> showing five Halloween classics across five nights.</p><p>From witches and 90s cult favourites to slashers and forest-footage nightmares, we've got something for every level of Halloween lover:</p><p>🧙 Monday 26th: <strong><strong>The Craft</strong></strong><br>🔪 Tuesday 27th: <strong><strong>Scream</strong></strong><br>📹 Wednesday 28th: <strong><strong>The Blair Witch Project</strong></strong><br>🎃 Thursday 29th: <strong><strong>Halloween</strong></strong><br>🧹 Friday 30th: <strong><strong>Hocus Pocus (with Halloween Party to follow £10 a ticket)</strong></strong></p><p>Grab something cold from the bar, get your popcorn and settle in as the garden gets darker and the films get scarier.</p><p><strong><strong>Five films. Five nights. One big screen.</strong></strong></p><p><br></p><p>🎃 <strong><strong>HALLOWEEN ON THE SCREEN AT THE GRIFFIN.</strong></strong></p><p>📍 The Griffin, Whetstone<br>🌙 Outdoor cinema in The Griffin garden<br>🎬 15ft big screen<br>🍿 Popcorn + Halloween treats<br>🍹 Full bar open throughout<br>👻 Full Halloween garden takeover</p>",
                "alignment": "left",
                "url": null,
